<QuestionLayout
  title="What is exact-ref model execution in Traverse?"
  description="Discover → execute → trace on one shared runtime.wasm. Signed schema 2.0.0 + model.sig.json. Published exact-ref: native, web, Swift swift-host-v0.14.0-4. Kotlin and .NET hosts are on main, not in 0.14.0 (#1651)."
